Today", "type": "word", "start": 22.72, "end": 22.96}, {"text": "you'll", "type": "word", "start": 23.28, "end": 23.44}, {"text": "measure", "type": "word", "start": 23.52, "end": 23.76}, {"text": "long", "type": "word", "start": 23.84, "end": 24.08}, {"text": "distances", "type": "word", "start": 24.16, "end": 24.8}, {"text": "in", "type": "word", "start": 24.88, "end": 24.96}, {"text": "kilometers", "type": "word", "start": 25.04, "end": 25.68}, {"text": "and", "type": "word", "start": 25.84, "end": 25.92}, {"text": "meters.", "type": "word", "start": 26, "end": 26.88}]}, "think-1": {"text": "Before the test, a messenger runs a note from the workshop up to the tower. The path is one thousand nine hundred meters long. Build it out of hundred-meter pieces, and watch what happens at ten.", "words": [{"text": "Before", "type": "word", "start": 0, "end": 0.367}, {"text": "the", "type": "word", "start": 0.4, "end": 0.467}, {"text": "test,", "type": "word", "start": 0.48, "end": 1.04}, {"text": "a", "type": "word", "start": 1.28, "end": 1.36}, {"text": "messenger", "type": "word", "start": 1.44, "end": 1.87}, {"text": "runs", "type": "word", "start": 1.92, "end": 2.24}, {"text": "a", "type": "word", "start": 2.28, "end": 2.32}, {"text": "note", "type": "word", "start": 2.4, "end": 2.64}, {"text": "from", "type": "word", "start": 2.72, "end": 2.8}, {"text": "the", "type": "word", "start": 2.84, "end": 2.88}, {"text": "workshop", "type": "word", "start": 2.96, "end": 3.52}, {"text": "up", "type": "word", "start": 3.68, "end": 3.84}, {"text": "to", "type": "word", "start": 3.92, "end": 4}, {"text": "the", "type": "word", "start": 4.04, "end": 4.08}, {"text": "tower.", "type": "word", "start": 4.16, "end": 4.88}, {"text": "The", "type": "word", "start": 5.2, "end": 5.28}, {"text": "path", "type": "word", "start": 5.44, "end": 5.6}, {"text": "is", "type": "word", "start": 5.68, "end": 5.84}, {"text": "one", "type": "word", "start": 5.92, "end": 6}, {"text": "thousand", "type"